  - option-a
body: 'Next: build breakdown to make $agent-purchase-flow demoable end-to-end with the mock verifier. Ownership recap: the World ID Selfie Check itself is the USER''s piece; the merchant MCP + server-side ^personhood-verified gate + mock verifier are ours. MCP scope stays ''our store only'' for now. Docs to read: docs.world.org/world-id/overview, docs.world.org/world-id/idkit/integrate, docs.world.org/llms.txt (index for the Selfie-Check-specific + MiniKit/deep-link pages, not yet pulled).'
